{"availability":"available","full":"nuzulul/wifidrop","name":"wifidrop","description":"Local peer-to-peer file transfer via WIFI with auto discovery alternative to AirDrop and LocalSend.","category":"Other","language":"JavaScript","stars":14,"forks":2,"created":"2024-10-01T11:43:54Z","updated":"2026-04-09T04:11:08Z","license":"GPL-3.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://wifidrop.js.org","topics":["airdrop","file-sharing","file-transfer","file-upload","localsend","p2p","pwa","webrtc"],"demo":"https://wifidrop.js.org/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T19:22:39.930Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-05T19:22:39.930Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-05T19:22:39.930Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-05T19:22:39.930Z","stars":14,"forks":2}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Local peer-to-peer file transfer via WIFI with auto discovery alternative to AirDrop and LocalSend.","WIFIDrop is an easy-to-use progressive web app (PWA) that allows users to transfer large files between devices over the same WIFI network. Files are transferred securely peer-to-peer via WebRTC without any intermediary servers. Therefore this application is a completely client side application and can be deploy on any static hosting or localhost."],"features":["✅ Support P2P direct connection whenever possible.","✅ No need to create an account or register.","✅ Automatically discover devices on the same WIFI network.","✅ Transfer large files between devices.","✅ Copy paste from the clipboard between devices."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/nuzulul/wifidrop/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"f5095780ed779b7255cbfc6047209cfb4f7533d44157679191aadd3f66c40e76","extractedAt":"2026-10-05T19:22:40.213Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T19:22:40.213Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Local peer-to-peer file transfer via WIFI with auto discovery alternative to AirDrop and LocalSend.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/nuzulul/wifidrop/blob/main